    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hawa walikuwa wazao wa Lawi kwa jamaa zao. Wakuu wa jamaa kama walivyoandikwa kwa majina yao na kuhesabiwa kila mmoja, yaani, wenye uwezo wa kufanya kazi kuanzia miaka ishirini au zaidi, waliohudumu katika Hekalu la",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.23.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa maana Daudi alikuwa amesema, \"Kwa vile",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.23.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.23.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Mungu wa Israeli amewapa watu wake raha na amekuja kuishi Yerusalemu milele,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi hawahitaji tena kubeba Maskani wala chombo chochote cha utumishi wake.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulingana na maagizo ya mwisho ya Daudi, Walawi waliohesabiwa ni wale wa kuanzia umri wa miaka ishirini au zaidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wajibu wa Walawi ulikuwa kuwasaidia wazao wa Aroni kuhudumu katika Hekalu la",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.23.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": Kuwa wasimamizi wa nyua, vyumba vya pembeni, kutakasa vyombo vitakatifu na utendaji mwingine wowote katika nyumba ya Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walikuwa wasimamizi wa mikate iliyowekwa mezani, unga kwa ajili ya sadaka za nafaka, mikate isiyotiwa chachu, uokaji na uchanganyaji, pamoja na vipimo vyote vya wingi na ukubwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pia ulikuwa wajibu wao kila asubuhi kumshukuru na kumsifu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.23.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Iliwapasa pia kufanya hivyo jioni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na wakati wowote sadaka za kuteketezwa zilipotolewa kwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.23.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "siku za Sabato na kwenye sikukuu za Mwezi Mwandamo na katika sikukuu nyingine zilizoamriwa. Iliwapasa kuhudumu mbele za",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1CH.23.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mara kwa mara kwa idadi maalum na kwa namna waliyokuwa wamepewa maelekezo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
